  WrittenDialogue: "I don’t know about all this. Are you sure the people are in your best interest?\nThe people are always in my best interest!\nWhat about this person!\nHey!\nHunter?? I thought you died in my pool!\nYour pool!?\nShe’s a fraud! She lied!\nYo we should kill this bitch!\nShe left me for dead, I was in a coma for 10 years!\nNot only dishonest but you were the one who killed him?\nNever vote for Kelly she let me die technically!\nWait no! Come on guys there’s a perfectly good explanation.\nDid I mention Helping Hands has free catering for non-members?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KAREN\nKELLY\nJEFFERY\nHUNTER\nKELLY\nKAREN\nCOP\nKYLAR\nHUNTER\nKAREN\nHUNTER\nKELLY\nKELLY"
